<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="eyebrow">FITNESS · 私有图片辅助</text>
    <text class="title">拍照识别现有食材</text>
    <text class="subtitle">图片仅用于给出候选名称，系统不会从照片猜测克数、热量或营养素。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">1. 选择并上传图片</text>
    <text class="section-help">支持相册或相机中的一张 JPEG/PNG 图片，客户端先检查 10 MiB 上限，服务端仍会权威复核文件内容。</text>
    <image wx:if="{{localPreviewPath}}" class="preview" src="{{localPreviewPath}}" mode="aspectFit" aria-label="待上传食材图片预览" />
    <button class="button button--secondary button--wide" loading="{{choosing}}" disabled="{{choosing || uploading}}" bindtap="onChoosePhoto">{{choosing ? '正在选择…' : '从相册或相机选择图片'}}</button>
    <button class="button button--primary button--wide" loading="{{uploading}}" disabled="{{!canUpload || uploading}}" bindtap="onUploadPhoto">{{uploading ? '正在私密上传并登记…' : '上传并登记图片'}}</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="section-title">2. 单独发起识别</text>
    <text class="section-help">视觉服务只返回映射到审核食材数据的候选，不会直接写入库存。</text>
    <button class="button button--primary button--wide" loading="{{recognizing}}" disabled="{{!canRecognize || recognizing}}" bindtap="onRecognizePhoto">{{recognizing ? '正在识别候选…' : '识别候选食材'}}</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{candidates.length > 0}}" class="card">
    <text class="section-title">3. 明确选择候选</text>
    <text class="section-help">估算识别结果，请确认。候选不会自动预选。</text>
    <radio-group class="candidate-list" bindchange="onCandidateChange">
      <label wx:for="{{candidates}}" wx:key="id" class="candidate">
        <radio value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{selectedCandidateId === item.id}}" />
        <view class="candidate__content">
          <text class="candidate__name">{{item.canonicalNameZh}}</text>
          <text class="candidate__meta">{{item.foodStateText}} · {{item.confidenceText}}</text>
          <text class="candidate__notice">{{item.confirmationLabel}}</text>
        </view>
      </label>
    </radio-group>

    <label wx:if="{{showGramsInput}}" class="field">
      <text class="field__label">你估算的可用重量（克）</text>
      <input class="field__control" type="number" value="{{gramsText}}" bindinput="onGramsInput" placeholder="请输入正整数克数" aria-label="用户估算的可用重量（克）" />
      <text class="field__hint">克数由你明确提供，不来自图片识别。</text>
    </label>
    <button wx:if="{{showGramsInput}}" class="button button--primary button--wide" loading="{{confirming}}" disabled="{{confirming}}" bindtap="onConfirmCandidate">{{confirming ? '正在确认写入库存…' : '确认候选与克数并写入库存'}}</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{statusMessage}}" class="notice notice--neutral" aria-live="polite">{{statusMessage}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{successMessage}}" class="notice notice--success" aria-live="polite">{{successMessage}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="notice notice--error" aria-role="alert" aria-live="assertive">{{errorMessage}}</view>

  <view class="card card--fallback">
    <text class="section-title">不使用照片也能继续</text>
    <text class="section-help">上传、登记或识别失败不会阻断核心流程。</text>
    <button class="button button--secondary button--wide" bindtap="onManualEntry">手动录入食材</button>
  </view>

  <text class="disclaimer">原图保存在私有路径，按清理策略处理；确认前不会写入正式库存，也不会触发营养或餐单重算。</text>
</view>
